# yolobox build context is tiny: only a few files are actually COPYd into the
# image. Everything else is host-side tooling (launcher, docs) and must
# never bloat the build context or leak into a layer. Ignore-all, then re-allow
# exactly what the Dockerfile needs.
*

# Re-include only the files the Dockerfile COPYs.
!entrypoint.sh
!herd-report.sh
!tools
!tools/**
!mcp
!mcp/**
!yolobox-shell
!yolobox-init
!.shellcheckrc
